---
const { zh } = Astro.props;
---
    <!-- ===== AI ASSISTANT ===== -->
    <div class="page" id="page-ai">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-title">🤖 {zh ? "AI 分析助手（模拟演示）" : "AI Analysis Assistant (Simulated)"}</div>
        <div class="card-desc">{zh ? "SDK 内置 Agent 规划即将上线：通过自然语言对话调用 120 种分析能力（117 可用）。现有两条外部通道——MCP 工具与命令行 CLI；Python SDK 仍在规划中。以下为交互模拟。" : "Built-in Agent (planned): conversational access to 120 capabilities (117 available). Two external channels exist today — MCP tools and the CLI; the Python SDK is still planned. Interactive simulation below."}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div id="ai-chat" class="ai-chat"></div>
        <div class="ai-chips">
          <button class="ai-chip" onclick="playAI(0)">🔬 {zh ? "FASTQ 质量检查" : "FASTQ quality check"}</button>
          <button class="ai-chip" onclick="playAI(1)">📊 {zh ? "差异表达分析" : "Differential expression"}</button>
          <button class="ai-chip" onclick="playAI(2)">🧬 {zh ? "变异统计" : "Variant stats"}</button>
          <button class="ai-chip" onclick="clearAI()">🗑 {zh ? "清空对话" : "Clear chat"}</button>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-input">
          <input type="text" placeholder={zh ? "在此输入…（演示版由上方示例驱动）" : "Type here… (demo driven by the examples above)"} readonly>
          <button onclick="playAI(Math.floor(Math.random()*3))">{zh ? "发送" : "Send"}</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
